# Regenerable and large. The HTTP cache is disposable by definition, and the
# per-coin history store can be rebuilt from the API at any time.
data/cache/
data/history/*.parquet

# Snapshots and portfolio state are deliberately NOT ignored: the dated
# snapshots ARE the point-in-time record that makes forward results honest,
# and state.json is the forward track record. Both must be versioned.
